  "type": "Album",
  "description": "Tango in the Night is the fourteenth studio album by the British-American rock band Fleetwood Mac, released on 13 April 1987 by Warner Bros. Records. It is the fifth and final studio album with the band's most successful lineup of Lindsey Buckingham, Mick Fleetwood, Christine McVie, John McVie, and Stevie Nicks, though Christine McVie would make guest appearances on the band's 2003 album, Say You Will. This lineup did not reconvene again for another album until 1997's live album The Dance.",
